# The dispatch contract of v24_ingest_small (fuller safety::Contract, the format of
# problems/kmeans_assign/safety.contract), from problem.toml's run program:
# every dispatch is 1-D; ingest is per_section workgroups (500), search
# n_queries (250). The cfg ranges are the program's words, the uniform
# variable named cfg as contract.md gives it: seed_slot 0..3, stage
# 1..stages, the arrived rows 0..stages * per_section, pass_index below
# n_passes (at most 16), c_max always 64. The legality checker's layer 7
# proves a kernel of this problem under it.
workgroups x 1 500
workgroups y 1 1
workgroups z 1 1
param cfg.seed_slot 0 3
param cfg.stage 1 5
param cfg.arrived_begin 0 2000
param cfg.arrived_end 500 2500
param cfg.n_queries 1 250
param cfg.pass_index 0 15
param cfg.n_passes 1 16
param cfg.c_max 64 64
# The design's own state (fuller 9994fc8): index_u32 and index_f32 are arenas, read by
# layer 7 in arena mode only (Contract::with_arena_mode; strict, the default, ignores
# them). Their lengths are this problem's arena_u32 and arena_f32 (problem.toml), in words.
arena index_u32 index_f32
param arrayLength(index_u32) 8388608 8388608
param arrayLength(index_f32) 8388608 8388608
